 listen in on third-party applications and wrote a script to filter out relevant pieces of data that were being sent back to an application\u2019s server. The findings of this study concluded that third-party iOS applications have unmonitored power to access pieces of information like contacts, location, and emails.","topics":[],"score":180895,"global_rank":402301}]